
<p>Apple Newsroom:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Apple and Ford today announced that Apple Maps will be integrated
directly into Ford’s upcoming Universal Electric Vehicle (UEV)
Platform through Apple’s new MapKit for Automotive SDK. Coming to
Ford’s UEV Platform in 2027, this integration will deliver a
beautiful and easy-to-use navigation experience powered by Apple
Maps directly to the vehicle’s displays. Road-level Maps
information will also enable Ford’s Latitude AI team to build a
seamless hands-free driving experience.</p>
</blockquote>

